UID:10011233-1780142400-1780156800@njaudubon.org
SUMMARY:Birds and Brews Family Fun Day
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Birds and Brews Family Fun Day! \nSupport New Jersey Audubon’s Lorrimer and Scherman Hoffman Sanctuaries. Join us for games\, activities\, and good times for all ages! Come join us at Fort Nonsense Brewing Company for a day of fun for the whole family. Enjoy a variety of activities focused on giving you a taste of nature camp fun while sipping delicious brews. \n**Activities** include camp favorite games\, animal encounters\, craft stations for the little ones\, live music by Kickstart\, Smash and Dash Food Truck\, and of course\, tasty brews for the adults. There will be something for everyone to enjoy! \nDon’t miss out on this fantastic event that combines nature\, creativity\, and relaxation. Grab your family and friends and join us for Birds and Brews Family Fun Day! \n\nPACKAGES: \n\n2 snack vouchers: $5\nYouth Ticket 3 years +: $10\nAdult Ticket 21 years +: $15\n\n\nFAQ: \nWhat does my ticket include? \n\nTickets provide access to fun games\, crafts\, activities and two snack passes per person good for either popcorn and/or cotton candy.\n\nDoes each person need a ticket? \n\nAdult 21+ Ticket: $15\, Youth 3+ Years Ticket: $10\n\nIs alcohol included in my ticket? \n\nNo. All alcohol and food truck purchases are made independently.\n\nCan I come to the event if I am not participating in the activities?` \n\nYes! The brewery is open to the public\, all are welcome!\n\nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/birds-and-brews-family-fun-day-2/
LOCATION:Fort Nonsense Brewing Company\, 220 Franklin Rd\, Randolph\, NJ\, 07869\, United States
CATEGORIES:Birding,Event,Family Program,Lorrimer Sanctuary,Nature Walk,Scherman Hoffman Wildlife Sanctuary
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://njaudubon.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Birds-and-Brews-Family-Fun-Day-2026.jpeg
GEO:40.8768064;-74.5315014
